  "releaseNotes": "While a cascade the eye went past by its whole box waits for its build, as after a cut, each frame builds every cascade at the most raised triangle budget, so a cut's view leaves the coarser cascades' light within frames.\nThe far cascade's band toward the light past its probes is weighed around the eye rather than in the cascade's grid, so a surface in it keeps its light as a walk moves the cascade a snap at once.\nbuild/flicker.py reads a second recording of the same turn pair by pair against the first, blurs both pictures of a pair by a radius, and carries its map of a turn back into the first picture's camera, as the voxel game asked.",
